{"text":"延昌二〔年〕□□，佛弟子代妙姬上爲亡父□□□，託生西方淨佛國土□□□□□命□得解脱□□。願一切衆生咸同斯福。佛弟子。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"代妙姬","refId":null,"text":"代妙姬","start":12,"end":15},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"託生","refId":null,"text":"託生","start":23,"end":25},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"西方","refId":null,"text":"西方","start":25,"end":27},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"淨佛國土","refId":null,"text":"淨佛國土","start":27,"end":31},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"解脫","refId":null,"text":"解脱","start":39,"end":41},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"衆生","start":47,"end":49}]}